  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The Council has significant evidence contrary to the submitted declaration. The aerial photographs show that a fundamental change was made to the structure in question when it was \"updated\". The size and materials are different, and so has to be considered as a new development. The submitted information does not provide enough evidence to show that the structure was constructed over four years ago. If anything, the information received supports the point that the conservatory was constructed in March 2010.\r\n6.2\tIt is thus recommended that the Certificate of Lawfulness for the retention of the conservatory be refused.\r\n"
  ],
